{"_id":"WmProfession0001","img":"icons/tools/smithing/anvil.webp","name":"Blacksmithing","sort":10000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Blacksmithing Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Blacksmithing</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Quick Repair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Hellforging:</strong> Infernal weapons and armour shaped through fear, flame, sacrifice, and battle-tested tempers.</li><li><strong>Radiant Forging:</strong> Protective and cleansing equipment that channels light, healing, and defence of others.</li><li><strong>Azlanti Artifice:</strong> Ancient magitek, reverse-engineered machinery, original devices, and advanced infrastructure.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:blacksmithing"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","selector":"blacksmithing-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-blacksmithing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"blacksmithing","loreName":"Blacksmithing","craftingSpecialty":"blacksmithing","materialIds":["metal"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.ASy9AKEIRxPYUi5o","bonusFeatName":"Quick Repair","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Hellforging","description":"Infernal weapons and armour shaped through fear, flame, sacrifice, and battle-tested tempers.","proficiency":{"label":"Blacksmithing: Hellforging","description":"Dedicated Lore for Hellforging. It follows the existing Blacksmithing proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Infernal Temper","description":"Create Hellforged equipment built around fire, blood, fear, retaliation and dangerous power."},"mastery":{"label":"Furnace Without Mercy","description":"Reduce Hellforging special-resource cost by 20%; at high tier recover 50% of rare infernal components from dismantled Hellforged gear."},"legacy":{"label":"Infernal Foundry","description":"Supports elite army weapons, infernal siege ammunition and intimidating military infrastructure."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Radiant Forging","description":"Protective and cleansing equipment that channels light, healing, and defence of others.","proficiency":{"label":"Blacksmithing: Radiant Forging","description":"Dedicated Lore for Radiant Forging. It follows the existing Blacksmithing proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Radiant Temper","description":"Create protective, cleansing and celestial equipment, especially effective against undead, fiends and corruption."},"mastery":{"label":"Purified Forge","description":"Reduce sacred/celestial resource waste by 20% and improve repairs to Radiant equipment."},"legacy":{"label":"Beacon Works","description":"Supports hospitals, temples, settlement wards, anti-undead defences and sacred military equipment."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Azlanti Artifice","description":"Ancient magitek, reverse-engineered machinery, original devices, and advanced infrastructure.","proficiency":{"label":"Blacksmithing: Azlanti Artifice","description":"Dedicated Lore for Azlanti Artifice. It follows the existing Blacksmithing proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Lost Artifice","description":"Reverse-engineer ancient technology, repair magitek and invent designs beyond normal PF2e equipment lists."},"mastery":{"label":"Reverse Engineering","description":"Preserve the original device while producing a reusable blueprint; repeat builds take 25% less downtime."},"legacy":{"label":"Arcane Industrialisation","description":"Enables automated workshops, magical power, transport, constructs and advanced siege technology."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0002","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/professions/alchemy.png","name":"Alchemy","sort":20000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Alchemy Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Alchemy</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Alchemical Crafting</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Grand Apothecary:</strong> Refined potions and elixirs tailored for stability, duration, delivery, or specialised outcomes.</li><li><strong>Venomcraft:</strong> Custom toxins shaped around delivery, persistence, concealment, onset, or a chosen quarry.</li><li><strong>Transmutative Alchemy:</strong> Controlled material conversion and the creation of specialist composite substances.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:alchemy"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","selector":"alchemy-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-alchemy","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"alchemy","loreName":"Alchemy","craftingSpecialty":"alchemy","materialIds":["herbs"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.is3Oz9wt11lNq62K","bonusFeatName":"Alchemical Crafting","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Grand Apothecary","description":"Refined potions and elixirs tailored for stability, duration, delivery, or specialised outcomes.","proficiency":{"label":"Alchemy: Grand Apothecary","description":"Dedicated Lore for Grand Apothecary. It follows the existing Alchemy proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Refined Formula","description":"Customise medicines, potions and elixirs for potency, duration, administration and recovery."},"mastery":{"label":"Batch Distillation","description":"Produce 25% more doses from the same material input."},"legacy":{"label":"Royal Apothecary","description":"Supports hospitals, military medicine, plague response and settlement recovery."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Venomcraft","description":"Custom toxins shaped around delivery, persistence, concealment, onset, or a chosen quarry.","proficiency":{"label":"Alchemy: Venomcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Venomcraft. It follows the existing Alchemy proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Toxin Refinement","description":"Customise poisons by delivery, onset, target profile, stages and concealment."},"mastery":{"label":"Venom Harvesting","description":"Gain 25% more usable poison material from venomous creatures and reduce poison resource cost by 15%."},"legacy":{"label":"Master Toxicologist","description":"Supports antivenom, pest control, military toxins and intelligence operations."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Transmutative Alchemy","description":"Controlled material conversion and the creation of specialist composite substances.","proficiency":{"label":"Alchemy: Transmutative Alchemy","description":"Dedicated Lore for Transmutative Alchemy. It follows the existing Alchemy proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Material Transmutation","description":"Convert resource families and create composite materials for other artisans."},"mastery":{"label":"The Great Work","description":"Standard conversion is 2 units into 1 equal-tier unit; mastered high-tier conversions can improve to 3 into 2."},"legacy":{"label":"Transmutation Industry","description":"Converts surplus Kingdom resources and enables specialised industrial projects."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0003","img":"icons/magic/symbols/runes-star-pentagon-magenta.webp","name":"Enchanting","sort":30000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Enchanting Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Enchanting</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Magical Crafting</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Aethercasting:</strong> Controlled magical enhancements and the incremental upgrading of empowered items.</li><li><strong>Essencebinding:</strong> Approved item traits and harvested essences bound safely into qualifying equipment.</li><li><strong>Runecarving:</strong> Efficient rune creation, upgrading, transfer, and linked Rune Echoes.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:enchanting"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","selector":"enchanting-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-enchanting","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"enchanting","loreName":"Enchanting","craftingSpecialty":"enchanting","materialIds":["mana-crystals"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.xWY5omyIcILNR7y1","bonusFeatName":"Magical Crafting","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Aethercasting","description":"Controlled magical enhancements and the incremental upgrading of empowered items.","proficiency":{"label":"Enchanting: Aethercasting","description":"Dedicated Lore for Aethercasting. It follows the existing Enchanting proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Empowerment","description":"Create statistic-enhancing and magically sustained equipment that can intentionally push beyond ordinary PF2e ceilings."},"mastery":{"label":"Aether Refinement","description":"Upgrade an existing Empowerment by paying only the material difference and half normal upgrade downtime."},"legacy":{"label":"Permanent Enchantment","description":"Supports wards, magical utilities, powered workshops and settlement infrastructure."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Essencebinding","description":"Approved item traits and harvested essences bound safely into qualifying equipment.","proficiency":{"label":"Enchanting: Essencebinding","description":"Dedicated Lore for Essencebinding. It follows the existing Enchanting proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Bind Essence","description":"Add traits and supernatural creature/material properties the base item does not normally possess."},"mastery":{"label":"Deep Binding","description":"Higher-tier work supports stronger creature-derived properties and more complex essence interactions."},"legacy":{"label":"Essence Workshops","description":"Converts monster, planar and environmental essences into reusable crafting components."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Runecarving","description":"Efficient rune creation, upgrading, transfer, and linked Rune Echoes.","proficiency":{"label":"Enchanting: Runecarving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Runecarving. It follows the existing Enchanting proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Runic Logic","description":"Build persistent sigils and linked magical logic into equipment; this replaces the old assumption that normal PF2e property runes still exist."},"mastery":{"label":"Rune Resonance","description":"Linked sigils are easier to upgrade and can interact across paired items."},"legacy":{"label":"Runic Infrastructure","description":"Supports ward arrays, military sigils and public magical systems."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0004","img":"icons/tools/hand/needle-grey.webp","name":"Leatherwork","sort":40000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Leatherwork Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Leatherworking</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Experienced Tracker</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Wyrmcraft:</strong> Dragon-scale equipment that preserves an adaptation belonging to the source dragon.</li><li><strong>Beastbinding:</strong> Prepared hides that preserve a useful natural quality of the creature they came from.</li><li><strong>Mantlecraft:</strong> Prestigious and protective mantles, cloaks, robes, and environmental garments.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:leatherwork"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","selector":"leatherwork-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-leatherwork","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"leatherwork","loreName":"Leatherworking","craftingSpecialty":"leatherworking","materialIds":["leather","dragon-scale"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.urQZwmzg2kS53vd5","bonusFeatName":"Experienced Tracker","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Wyrmcraft","description":"Dragon-scale equipment that preserves an adaptation belonging to the source dragon.","proficiency":{"label":"Leatherwork: Wyrmcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Wyrmcraft. It follows the existing Leatherwork proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Draconic Essence","description":"Preserve and exploit qualities from dragon type, colour and age in armour, weapons and reinforcement. Dragon Scale Core and Reinforcement already provide native colour resistance; Wyrmcraft deepens or transforms that inheritance."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Harvest","description":"Gain more usable dragon material and reduce waste while preparing scales and hides."},"legacy":{"label":"Dragonworks","description":"Creates elite army equipment, prestige goods, diplomatic trophies and draconic settlement works."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Beastbinding","description":"Prepared hides that preserve a useful natural quality of the creature they came from.","proficiency":{"label":"Leatherwork: Beastbinding","description":"Dedicated Lore for Beastbinding. It follows the existing Leatherwork proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Preserve the Beast","description":"Retain a natural or supernatural quality from the creature whose hide/material was used."},"mastery":{"label":"Master Harvester","description":"Improve creature-material yield and preserve delicate traits that ordinary harvesting would destroy."},"legacy":{"label":"Monstercraft Trade","description":"Turns rare creature materials into specialist exports and campaign resources."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Mantlecraft","description":"Prestigious and protective mantles, cloaks, robes, and environmental garments.","proficiency":{"label":"Leatherwork: Mantlecraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Mantlecraft. It follows the existing Leatherwork proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Great Mantles","description":"Create exceptional cloaks, coats, ceremonial furs and environmental garments."},"mastery":{"label":"Luxury Craftsmanship","description":"Reduce rare-fur waste and substantially increase trade/prestige value."},"legacy":{"label":"Royal Clothier","description":"Supports diplomacy, gifts, court prestige and luxury industry."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0005","img":"icons/tools/hand/hammer-and-nail.webp","name":"Carpentry","sort":50000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Carpentry Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Carpentry</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Hefty Hauler</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Warbowyer:</strong> Engineered bows, crossbows, ballistae, loading systems, and specialist ammunition.</li><li><strong>Masterwright:</strong> Bridges, roads, docks, fieldworks, buildings, and major wooden structures.</li><li><strong>Warcarving:</strong> Combat forms and utility carvings applied to wooden weapons, shields, and tools.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:carpentry"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","selector":"carpentry-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-carpentry","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"carpentry","loreName":"Carpentry","craftingSpecialty":"woodworking","materialIds":["wood"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.C0Tcelg3BAPhML6J","bonusFeatName":"Hefty Hauler","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Warbowyer","description":"Engineered bows, crossbows, ballistae, loading systems, and specialist ammunition.","proficiency":{"label":"Carpentry: Warbowyer","description":"Dedicated Lore for Warbowyer. It follows the existing Carpentry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Engineered Ranged Weapons","description":"Build bows, crossbows, ballistae, specialist ammunition and advanced loading mechanisms."},"mastery":{"label":"Master Fletching","description":"Produce ammunition efficiently and maintain engineered ranged weapons with reduced waste."},"legacy":{"label":"Missile Industry","description":"Improves army archers, towers, ballistae and settlement ranged defence."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Masterwright","description":"Bridges, roads, docks, fieldworks, buildings, and major wooden structures.","proficiency":{"label":"Carpentry: Masterwright","description":"Dedicated Lore for Masterwright. It follows the existing Carpentry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Great Works","description":"Build bridges, roads, palisades, docks, towers, camps and major wooden infrastructure."},"mastery":{"label":"Efficient Construction","description":"Reduce Lumber cost and repair downtime for qualifying projects."},"legacy":{"label":"Kingdom Builder","description":"Improves construction throughput, roads, fortifications, settlement expansion and repairs."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Warcarving","description":"Combat forms and utility carvings applied to wooden weapons, shields, and tools.","proficiency":{"label":"Carpentry: Warcarving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Warcarving. It follows the existing Carpentry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Carved Form","description":"Add combat identities and totemic properties to wooden weapons, shields and tools."},"mastery":{"label":"Deep Carving","description":"Preserve increasingly complex magical/totemic carvings without weakening the wood."},"legacy":{"label":"Carved Traditions","description":"Supports ceremonial weapons, military equipment and cultural relics."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0006","img":"icons/tools/hand/chisel-steel-brown.webp","name":"Stonemasonry","sort":60000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Stonemasonry Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Stonemasonry</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Megalithics:</strong> Monumental works, fortresses, roads, aqueducts, walls, and major civil structures.</li><li><strong>Runemasonry:</strong> Wardstones and enduring magical inscriptions that protect places rather than carried items.</li><li><strong>Titanmasonry:</strong> Stone wargear, constructs, siege engines, and powerful Titanic forms.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:stonemason"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","selector":"stonemason-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-stonemason","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"stonemason","loreName":"Stonemasonry","craftingSpecialty":"stonemasonry","materialIds":["stone"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Megalithics","description":"Monumental works, fortresses, roads, aqueducts, walls, and major civil structures.","proficiency":{"label":"Stonemasonry: Megalithics","description":"Dedicated Lore for Megalithics. It follows the existing Stonemasonry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Great Works","description":"Create fortresses, roads, aqueducts, monumental walls, towers and vast stone projects."},"mastery":{"label":"Monumental Engineering","description":"Reduce Stone waste and repair time for major works."},"legacy":{"label":"Civilisation Builder","description":"Transforms settlements through enduring infrastructure and wonders."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Runemasonry","description":"Wardstones and enduring magical inscriptions that protect places rather than carried items.","proficiency":{"label":"Stonemasonry: Runemasonry","description":"Dedicated Lore for Runemasonry. It follows the existing Stonemasonry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Wardstones","description":"Bind magical zones, alarms, protections and restrictions to locations rather than carried items."},"mastery":{"label":"Deep Inscription","description":"Increase ward area, duration and magical stability."},"legacy":{"label":"Great Wards","description":"Protects settlements from intrusion, teleportation, undead, weather and magical assault."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Titanmasonry","description":"Stone wargear, constructs, siege engines, and powerful Titanic forms.","proficiency":{"label":"Stonemasonry: Titanmasonry","description":"Dedicated Lore for Titanmasonry. It follows the existing Stonemasonry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Titanic Construction","description":"Create stone armour, colossal shields, siege devices, constructs and crushing wargear."},"mastery":{"label":"Mountaincraft","description":"Make enormous stone components usable without losing impossible stability."},"legacy":{"label":"Stone Legions","description":"Supports constructs, fortifications and siege warfare."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0007","img":"icons/commodities/materials/glass-orb-blue.webp","name":"Glassmaking","sort":70000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Glassmaking Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Glassmaking</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Prismcraft:</strong> Lenses and prisms that focus, split, redirect, or transform light and magical energy.</li><li><strong>Mirrorcraft:</strong> Reflective magic, illusions, scrying, communication, and linked mirrors.</li><li><strong>Aetherglass:</strong> Mana batteries, spell reservoirs, magical circuitry, construct cores, and powered components.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:glassmaking"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","selector":"glassmaking-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-glassmaking","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"glassmaking","loreName":"Glassmaking","craftingSpecialty":"glassmaking","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Prismcraft","description":"Lenses and prisms that focus, split, redirect, or transform light and magical energy.","proficiency":{"label":"Glassmaking: Prismcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Prismcraft. It follows the existing Glassmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Arcane Optics","description":"Focus, split, redirect and transform light or magical energy with precision lenses and prisms."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Refraction","description":"Safely handle stronger magical energy and reduce material loss in advanced optical components."},"legacy":{"label":"Observatory Craft","description":"Supports surveying, astronomy, navigation, signalling and watchtowers."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Mirrorcraft","description":"Reflective magic, illusions, scrying, communication, and linked mirrors.","proficiency":{"label":"Glassmaking: Mirrorcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Mirrorcraft. It follows the existing Glassmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Reflection","description":"Create supernatural mirrors for illusion, scrying, communication, defence and travel."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Reflection","description":"Safely reflect or retain increasingly powerful magical phenomena."},"legacy":{"label":"Mirror Network","description":"Links settlements for communication, intelligence and eventually transport."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Aetherglass","description":"Mana batteries, spell reservoirs, magical circuitry, construct cores, and powered components.","proficiency":{"label":"Glassmaking: Aetherglass","description":"Dedicated Lore for Aetherglass. It follows the existing Glassmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Mana Conduction","description":"Build mana batteries, spell reservoirs, magical circuitry and construct cores."},"mastery":{"label":"Aether Cells","description":"Store progressively greater magical energy with less loss and safer discharge."},"legacy":{"label":"Arcane Grid","description":"Powers large-scale magical infrastructure and magitek networks."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0008","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/professions/pottery.png","name":"Pottery","sort":80000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Pottery Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Pottery</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Ceramancy:</strong> Living clay, terracotta constructs, ceramic armour, figurines, and guardians.</li><li><strong>Reliquarycraft:</strong> Vessels that preserve blessings, curses, spirits, essences, and planar energy.</li><li><strong>Pyroceramics:</strong> Crucibles, bomb casings, heat-resistant vessels, magical kilns, and industrial ceramics.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:pottery"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","selector":"pottery-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-pottery","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"pottery","loreName":"Pottery","craftingSpecialty":"pottery","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Ceramancy","description":"Living clay, terracotta constructs, ceramic armour, figurines, and guardians.","proficiency":{"label":"Pottery: Ceramancy","description":"Dedicated Lore for Ceramancy. It follows the existing Pottery proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Living Clay","description":"Create supernatural ceramics, terracotta guardians and adaptive ceramic armour."},"mastery":{"label":"Awakened Kiln","description":"Build increasingly complex animated ceramics with less breakage and better control."},"legacy":{"label":"Terracotta Works","description":"Supports workers, guardians, soldiers and settlement sentinels."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Reliquarycraft","description":"Vessels that preserve blessings, curses, spirits, essences, and planar energy.","proficiency":{"label":"Pottery: Reliquarycraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Reliquarycraft. It follows the existing Pottery proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Vessel of Essence","description":"Capture and safely preserve supernatural essences, spirits, curses, blessings and planar energy."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Containment","description":"Safely house stronger and more volatile essences with less risk of leakage or corruption."},"legacy":{"label":"Great Reliquaries","description":"Supports temples, magical institutions, cursed-artifact storage and spirit containment."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Pyroceramics","description":"Crucibles, bomb casings, heat-resistant vessels, magical kilns, and industrial ceramics.","proficiency":{"label":"Pottery: Pyroceramics","description":"Dedicated Lore for Pyroceramics. It follows the existing Pottery proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Cruciblecraft","description":"Create bomb casings, furnaces, crucibles, pressure vessels and extreme-temperature components."},"mastery":{"label":"Grand Kiln","description":"Improve industrial/alchemical throughput and reduce failures when processing extreme heat materials."},"legacy":{"label":"Industrial Kilns","description":"Supports bricks, pipes, sanitation, forges, alchemy and mass production."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0009","img":"icons/tools/hand/needle-grey.webp","name":"Weaving","sort":90000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Weaving Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Weaving</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Aetherweaving:</strong> Manathread and magical cloth that carry enchantments, wards, and arcane patterns.</li><li><strong>Ironweaving:</strong> Warcloth, armour backing, nets, ropes, bowstrings, sails, and resilient reinforcement.</li><li><strong>Heraldweaving:</strong> Standards, banners, and tapestries supporting morale, identity, armies, and prestige.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:weaving"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","selector":"weaving-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-weaving","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"weaving","loreName":"Weaving","craftingSpecialty":"weaving","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Aetherweaving","description":"Manathread and magical cloth that carry enchantments, wards, and arcane patterns.","proficiency":{"label":"Weaving: Aetherweaving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Aetherweaving. It follows the existing Weaving proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Manathread","description":"Produce magically conductive fabric capable of storing, carrying and shaping supernatural energy."},"mastery":{"label":"Arcane Loom","description":"Weave stronger magical fibres and exotic feedstocks without losing their properties."},"legacy":{"label":"Magical Textile Industry","description":"Supports magical garments, banners, specialist exports and arcane infrastructure."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Ironweaving","description":"Warcloth, armour backing, nets, ropes, bowstrings, sails, and resilient reinforcement.","proficiency":{"label":"Weaving: Ironweaving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Ironweaving. It follows the existing Weaving proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Warcloth","description":"Produce armour backing, nets, ropes, strings, sails and flexible reinforcement designed for combat stress."},"mastery":{"label":"Steel Thread","description":"Integrate stronger materials without sacrificing flexibility."},"legacy":{"label":"Military Textiles","description":"Supports armour, siege gear, sails, ropes and army equipment."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Heraldweaving","description":"Standards, banners, and tapestries supporting morale, identity, armies, and prestige.","proficiency":{"label":"Weaving: Heraldweaving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Heraldweaving. It follows the existing Weaving proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Great Standards","description":"Create banners and tapestries that carry morale, identity and supernatural command presence."},"mastery":{"label":"Living Heraldry","description":"Standards grow more potent when tied to a recognised army, ruler, settlement or company."},"legacy":{"label":"National Identity","description":"Supports armies, festivals, loyalty, diplomacy and prestige."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0010","img":"icons/sundries/books/book-tooled-gold-brown.webp","name":"Bookmaking","sort":100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Bookmaking Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Bookmaking</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Grimoirecraft:</strong> Living spellbooks and codices with enhanced memory, resonance, organisation, and access.</li><li><strong>Chroniclecraft:</strong> Lore, formulae, techniques, and Codices of Mastery that make recorded knowledge usable.</li><li><strong>Grand Cartography:</strong> Master atlases for exploration, resources, roads, armies, settlements, and expansion.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:bookmaking"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","selector":"bookmaking-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-bookmaking","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"bookmaking","loreName":"Bookmaking","craftingSpecialty":"bookmaking","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Grimoirecraft","description":"Living spellbooks and codices with enhanced memory, resonance, organisation, and access.","proficiency":{"label":"Bookmaking: Grimoirecraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Grimoirecraft. It follows the existing Bookmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Living Grimoires","description":"Create spellbooks and codices that interact directly with spell preparation, memory and magical resonance."},"mastery":{"label":"Arcane Codex","description":"Improve magical capacity, indexing and stability while reducing time to expand or revise the grimoire."},"legacy":{"label":"Grand Academies","description":"Supports magical education, spell research and institutional knowledge."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Chroniclecraft","description":"Lore, formulae, techniques, and Codices of Mastery that make recorded knowledge usable.","proficiency":{"label":"Bookmaking: Chroniclecraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Chroniclecraft. It follows the existing Bookmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Codices of Mastery","description":"Record Lore, formulae, techniques and expertise precisely enough that others can temporarily benefit from it."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Instruction","description":"Preserve increasingly advanced knowledge while reducing training/research time."},"legacy":{"label":"Great Library","description":"Improves research, education, formula preservation and Culture."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Grand Cartography","description":"Master atlases for exploration, resources, roads, armies, settlements, and expansion.","proficiency":{"label":"Bookmaking: Grand Cartography","description":"Dedicated Lore for Grand Cartography. It follows the existing Bookmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Master Atlas","description":"Create maps that record resources, hazards, routes, magical phenomena and strategic terrain."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Survey","description":"Reveal hidden resources and improve route accuracy with less exploration time."},"legacy":{"label":"Kingdom Survey","description":"Improves hex claims, roads, army movement, settlement placement and resource exploitation."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0011","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/professions/tailoring.png","name":"Tailoring","sort":110000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Tailoring Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Tailoring</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Battlestitching:</strong> Combat garments and armour liners designed for movement, access, protection, and adaptation.</li><li><strong>Veilcraft:</strong> Supernatural disguises, stealth clothing, concealing mantles, and perception-altering garments.</li><li><strong>Regaliacraft:</strong> Vestments of authority supporting diplomacy, leadership, morale, royal courts, and prestige.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy benefits follow the Wrathmaker profession rules. Artisan Marks are selected and anchored to items in the Wrathmaker Workbench.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:tailoring"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","selector":"tailoring-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-tailoring","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":4,"id":"tailoring","loreName":"Tailoring","craftingSpecialty":"tailoring","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Battlestitching","description":"Combat garments and armour liners designed for movement, access, protection, and adaptation.","proficiency":{"label":"Tailoring: Battlestitching","description":"Dedicated Lore for Battlestitching. It follows the existing Tailoring proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"War Garments","description":"Create combat robes, coats, armour liners, harnesses and flexible protection."},"mastery":{"label":"Combat Cut","description":"Increase protection without sacrificing movement and reduce material waste when refitting worn gear."},"legacy":{"label":"Military Tailoring","description":"Supports elite uniforms, armour liners and specialised army equipment."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Veilcraft","description":"Supernatural disguises, stealth clothing, concealing mantles, and perception-altering garments.","proficiency":{"label":"Tailoring: Veilcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Veilcraft. It follows the existing Tailoring proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Impossible Garments","description":"Manipulate sight, sound, shadow, identity and supernatural concealment through clothing."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Veil","description":"Improve disguise/concealment reliability and reduce the signs left by supernatural garments."},"legacy":{"label":"Shadow Service","description":"Supports scouts, spies, diplomats and intelligence networks."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Regaliacraft","description":"Vestments of authority supporting diplomacy, leadership, morale, royal courts, and prestige.","proficiency":{"label":"Tailoring: Regaliacraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Regaliacraft. It follows the existing Tailoring proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Vestments of Authority","description":"Create royal, diplomatic, ceremonial and command garments that reinforce office and presence."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Regalia","description":"Regalia becomes stronger when properly tied to a recognised office, ruler or institution."},"legacy":{"label":"Royal Court","description":"Improves diplomacy, loyalty, leadership, festivals, prestige and foreign relations."}}}]}}}}
